#18600
The Gate Of The Recruit Yards~
   A gate in the palisade opens off the muster field into the Recruit Yards,
where the fort turns farmhands, refugees and orphans into soldiers in a
month, because it does not have two. A board by the gate is chalked with the
day's drill. The muster field lies west; the barracks run north.
~
