#18620
A Turn In The Proving Pits~
   The pits are a warren of cold stone passages under the yards, coated with
green fungus and lit by the odd sputtering torch. Chains hang from rings in
the wall, and not all of them are empty. The sergeants let the chained
things loose for recruits to fight, one at a time; some of them got loose on
their own.
~
