#18643
The Watch Balcony~
   A balcony high above the drill hall, open to the sky on the west side.
From here you can see over the wall: the grey country of the march, the
smoke of burning things, and very far off, a darkness on the horizon that is
not cloud. The sergeants bring every recruit up here once, so they know.
~
